@startuml
title Activity 04 - Loan Application (underwriting decision style)
start
|ApplicantPortal|
:Submit LOAN_APPLICATION;
:Upload supporting documents;
|LoanAPI|
:Validate completeness and KYC;
if (Complete?) then (yes)
  :Open application case;
else (no)
  :Request missing artifacts;
  stop
endif
|CreditBureau|
:Return credit score + liabilities;
|Rules|
:Calculate affordability and DTI;
if (Policy threshold passed?) then (yes)
  :Escalate to underwriter;
else (no)
  :Auto-decline with reason;
  stop
endif
|Underwriting|
:Perform manual review;
if (Decision?) then (Approved)
  :Generate offer package;
else (Conditional)
  :Request additional guarantor/docs;
  stop
else (Declined)
  :Publish decline outcome;
  stop
endif
|ApplicantPortal|
:Accept offer electronically;
fork
|LoanAPI|
:Create loan ACCOUNT and schedule;
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send approval and repayment reminders;
fork again
|Underwriting|
:Archive decision rationale;
end fork
stop
@enduml
